# Keep every text file LF in the working tree as well as in the index.
#
# Without this, git's autocrlf converts files to CRLF on checkout on Windows.
# A fresh clone would then hash the knowledge base and the generated logs
# differently from the machine that wrote them, which would break the
# determinism metric (spec §18.2) and the KB hash recorded with every result.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
